{"parse": {"title": "Ibou Badji", "pageid": 15298500, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"bandeau-container metadata bandeau-article bandeau-niveau-ebauche\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:5px\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Basketball_ball.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Basketball_ball.svg/40px-Basketball_ball.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Basketball_ball.svg/120px-Basketball_ball.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"389\" data-file-height=\"407\" /></a></span> <span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Nuvola_Senegalese_flag.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Nuvola_Senegalese_flag.svg/40px-Nuvola_Senegalese_flag.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Nuvola_Senegalese_flag.svg/120px-Nuvola_Senegalese_flag.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /></a></span></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\">\n<p><strong class=\"bandeau-titre\">Cet article est une <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:%C3%89bauche\" title=\"Aide:\u00c9bauche\">\u00e9bauche</a> concernant un joueur de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> <a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal\" title=\"S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\">s\u00e9n\u00e9galais</a>.</strong>\n</p>\n<div class=\"nomobile\">\nVous pouvez partager vos connaissances en l\u2019am\u00e9liorant (<b><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">comment&#160;?</a></b>) selon les recommandations des <a href=\"/wiki/Projet:Accueil\" title=\"Projet:Accueil\">projets correspondants</a>.</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container metadata homonymie hatnote\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Homonymie\" title=\"Aide:Homonymie\"><img alt=\"Page d\u2019aide sur l\u2019homonymie\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/20px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/40px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"375\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\">\n<p>Pour les articles homonymes, voir <a href=\"/wiki/Badji\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Badji\">Badji</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">Ibou Dianko Badji<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Ibou_Badji_16_CB_Canarias_FIBA_BCL_Athens_F4_20250511_(2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article Ibou Badji\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Ibou_Badji_16_CB_Canarias_FIBA_BCL_Athens_F4_20250511_%282%29.jpg/330px-Ibou_Badji_16_CB_Canarias_FIBA_BCL_Athens_F4_20250511_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"420\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Ibou_Badji_16_CB_Canarias_FIBA_BCL_Athens_F4_20250511_%282%29.jpg/960px-Ibou_Badji_16_CB_Canarias_FIBA_BCL_Athens_F4_20250511_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"5152\" data-file-height=\"7728\" /></a></span> <br />Ibou Dianko Badji en 2025.\n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Nom complet\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Ibou Dianko Badji\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"datasortkey\" data-sort-value=\"S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\"><span class=\"flagicon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Senegal.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\"><img alt=\"Drapeau du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Flag_of_Senegal.svg/20px-Flag_of_Senegal.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/t